    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 05 VISUAL GUIDE — WIDGETS &amp; FRONTEND</div>\n    <h4>One token source, a mechanical gate, and a written decision memory</h4>\n    <p>Paperclip makes design decisions that cannot silently rot — and stops exactly at the widget-composer boundary</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 330\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-05\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-05\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"285\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">ONE TOKEN SOURCE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">ui/src/index.css</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Tailwind v4 · @theme inline</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Baked at BUILD time</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">Change once → everywhere</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(320, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"285\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">MECHANICAL TOKEN GATE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">check:token-gates command</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Fails the build on a raw value</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Not a review convention — a gate</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">Cannot be forgotten</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(620, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"280\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b45309\">510-IMAGE BASELINE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">255 stories × light + dark</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Visual diffs are reviewed</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">A layout break is caught, not felt</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">Regression = red image</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 190)\">\n        <rect width=\"540\" height=\"125\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"28\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">THE DECISION SHEET — written memory for design</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"52\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Every UI choice is recorded with its reason, in a sheet the team actually reads.</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"74\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Newcomers inherit WHY, not just WHAT — the same discipline this study itself follows.</text>\n        <rect x=\"16\" y=\"88\" width=\"508\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n        <text x=\"24\" y=\"105\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#059669\">Also: an in-app DesignGuide so the pattern is discoverable while building.</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(580, 190)\">\n        <rect width=\"320\" height=\"125\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.07\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"28\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">THE BOUNDARY: no widget composer</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"52\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Paperclip has components and pages, but no</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"70\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">general widget system an end-user can compose.</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"94\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Our widgets architecture must be built — the</text>\n        <text x=\"16\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">token discipline here is the part we adopt.</text>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
